# umalator-global/not-in-game.json is now committed.
# It is regenerated locally from docs/master.mdb via `node umalator-global/build.mjs`;
# deploys read the committed version directly (master.mdb is not deployed).

# Generated bundles for apps that build-all.sh rebuilds on deploy.
# These are regenerated by the Cloudflare build, so they don't need to be tracked
# (tracking them only caused merge conflicts on generated output).
# NOTE: hp-calculator/, events/, and courseimages/ bundles are intentionally NOT
# listed here — build-all.sh does not rebuild them, so their committed bundles
# must stay tracked or the deploy would 404.
